{"id":"ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-distributive.md","title":"Distributive Lattice","display":"df-distributive — Distributive Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-distributive","aliases":["93-df-distributive"],"display":"df-distributive — Distributive Lattice","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-distributive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-distributive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-distributive — Distributive Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> is a lattice candidate; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistLat}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistLat}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distributive}\\vdash\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\n\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}(b\\vee^{\\mathbf L}c)=\n(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b)\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}c)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distributive}\\vdash\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\n\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}(b\\vee^{\\mathbf L}c)=\n(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b)\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}c)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier and operations are projections of the argument structure rather than free contextual symbols. In any lattice the displayed distributive law implies its dual.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ is a lattice candidate; $\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]], and $\\mathrm{DistLat}$ is defined here.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DistLat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}distributive}\\vdash\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\n\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}(b\\vee^{\\mathbf L}c)=\n(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b)\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}c)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":881,"backlinks":[{"id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0454a0272a142daa","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6dfa3af0b7ff312","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DistLat}$ is the distributive-lattice class of [[93-df-distributive]]."},{"id":"fc98242032b14823","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DistLat}$ is the distributive-lattice class of [[93-df-distributive]]."},{"id":"e724ed0eebd9a8cf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ and $\\mathrm{DistLat}$ are the classes defined in [[93-df-lattice]] and [[93-df-distributive]]."}],"outgoing":["3b5f38bd115ed203"]}